frontend-progress-workspace.md-53-  - Q1 resolved: merged `betterlook` f284ee5a; one model state seeded from `?model=` drives both the top-bar `ModelPicker` and the pinned `Composer` (`model`/`onModelChange`). Picking Gemini in the composer updated the top bar, picking Opus in the top bar updated the composer, next send carried Opus (shown as bubble metadata). `.screenshots/workspace-sync-1440.png`.
frontend-progress-workspace.md-54-  - Iframe mounts only after hydration so `onLoad` is never lost; before this a fresh load left the spinner stuck. Fresh load x3: spinner cleared each time.
frontend-progress-workspace.md:55:  - Focus rings rechecked after FE-A's `classNamePrefix` change: toolbar button 2px solid outline (`.screenshots/toolbar-focus-1440.png`), divider focus ring (`.screenshots/divider-focus-1440.png`).
frontend-progress-workspace.md-56-  - `.screenshots/workspace-1440-light.png`, `.screenshots/workspace-1440-dark.png`: borderless in both themes.
frontend-progress-workspace.md-57-  - Earlier in this item: merged `betterlook` 86718025; FE-A `Composer` and `ModelPicker` replace the placeholders; top-bar picker starts from the `model` param; mock reply is generic; sends in the workspace append to the chat.
frontend-progress-workspace.md-58-  - `.screenshots/e2e-workspace-1440.png`: typed on `/`, Enter, landed on `/workspace?prompt=Make+the+nav+sticky&model=gpt-5`; message shown, top picker GPT-5.
frontend-progress-workspace.md-59-  - `.screenshots/workspace-400-chat.png`, `.screenshots/workspace-400-preview.png`: below 640px a SegmentedControl switches Chat/Preview, divider hidden, no horizontal scroll (scrollWidth 400). Borderless holds.
frontend-progress-workspace.md-60-  - `.screenshots/divider-focus-1440.png`: divider shows no line at rest, a focus ring only on keyboard focus. Toolbar: ArrowRight moves focus Refresh to Open-in-new-tab.
frontend-progress-workspace.md-61-  - Iframe loading: Spinner over the frame until `onLoad`, again on refresh; `aria-busy` on the preview section.
frontend-progress-landing.md-42-  Orchestrator: set `devIndicators: false` in `apps/web/next.config.mjs` (dev badge overlaps the composer in screenshots).
frontend-progress-landing.md-43-  Commit: `a4163737`.
frontend-progress-landing.md:44:  Root cause of missing focus rings: app StyleX emitted the same atomic class names as Astryx (`x1t137rt` = `outline-style:none`) in a later layer, overriding Astryx's `:focus-visible` rule. `classNamePrefix: 'p'` in `babel.config.js` (as Astryx's example does) separates them.
frontend-progress-landing.md-45-  Composer: no ring or border when focused; `:focus-within` lifts the fill 5% toward text colour (light 241 to 229, dark 27 to 38). Attach, model picker and send show the Astryx focus-visible ring on Tab. `devIndicators: false` hides the Next badge.
frontend-progress-landing.md-46-  Checked at 1280 and 400 px, light and dark: no horizontal scroll at 400 px; Enter on empty or whitespace stays on `/` with Send disabled; Tab order Message, Attach, Model, Send; Enter on Send navigates.
frontend-progress-landing.md-47-  Screenshots: `.screenshots/05-{wide,narrow}-{light,dark}-{focused-empty,rest,tab-attach,tab-model,tab-send}.png`.
frontend-progress-landing.md-48-  Skipped: favicon (`/favicon.ico` 404 in the console), add when there is an icon.
frontend-progress-landing.md-49-  Contract change done as part of Polish: commit `1c6c0f63` (`feat(composer): optional controlled model via model and onModelChange`). Verified with a throwaway controlled parent (reverted): picker shows the parent's value, a pick calls `onModelChange`, submit sends the parent's value; landing (uncontrolled) unchanged.
